From c9484bddb58371fe89dad57f9e4bf18f664ce6ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: telegdyd <telegdyd93@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:18:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a5xx: feedback reads from the GMEM tile (probe),
 barrier classification

---
